---
---

<div class="system frame">
  <div class="block col-2-3">
    <header class="reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">The system.</p>
      <h2>One Fountain.<br>Wherever you go.</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="copy">
      <p class="reveal lead">
        Fountain comes in two forms because the world has more than one shape.
        A wearable Pen. A desktop Stand. Sharing one ambient operating layer
        — the same intelligence, projected to fit the moment.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal">
        Wear it. Set it down. Pick it back up. What it shows stays consistent.
        No app to open. No mode to switch. The world is the interface.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="forms reveal" aria-label="Pen and Stand">
      <span>Pen</span><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Stand</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-meta);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  header h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.038em;
    line-height: 0.98;
    margin: 0 0 clamp(40px, 6vh, 64px);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .copy {
    margin-bottom: clamp(40px, 6vh, 64px);
  }
  .copy p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 18px);
    line-height: 1.55;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1.4em;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .copy .lead {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .forms {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: clamp(16px, 2.4vw, 28px);
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: clamp(32px, 5vh, 48px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 56px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .forms .sep {
    color: var(--color-meta);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  [data-revealed="true"] header { transition-delay: 0ms; }
  [data-revealed="true"] .copy .lead { transition-delay: 200ms; }
  [data-revealed="true"] .copy p:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 360ms; }
  [data-revealed="true"] .forms { transition-delay: 540ms; }
</style>
